### ④ 타이포그래피
- **폰트 페어링**:
  - 영문: **Segoe UI** (Windows) / SF Pro (mac) / system-ui
  - 한글: 맑은 고딕 / Pretendard / Apple SD Gothic Neo
  - 코드: Cascadia Code / Consolas
- **위계**:
  - Display: 28px / 600 / 1.2
  - H1: 22px / 600 / 1.25
  - H2: 18px / 600 / 1.3
  - H3: 16px / 600 / 1.35
  - Body Large: 14px / 400 / 1.5
  - Body: 14px / 400 / 1.5
  - Body Small: 12px / 400 / 1.4
  - Caption: 11px / 600 / 1.3 (timestamp)

