          <span style="min-width:0;flex:1;"><b style="display:block;font:700 11px/1.3 inherit;">디자인 허브</b><small style="display:block;color:var(--card-fg-muted);font:400 9px/1.4 inherit;">파일 3개가 공유됨</small></span>
